5. ZERO-TELEMETRY & PRIVACY COMMITMENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Q-P1NG® is designed with an uncompromising OPSEC-first architecture:
  - ZERO TELEMETRY: The application does NOT embed cloud analytics, advertising
    trackers, identity tracking, or silent background telemetry.
  - ZERO SURVEILLANCE: Communications, encrypted vault records, local AI models,
    and voice transcriptions are processed strictly on-device or across peer-to-peer
    encrypted networks chosen by the user.
  - DATA MINIMIZATION: Private cryptographic keys (RSA, AES, Kyber/Dilithium) are
    generated and stored exclusively on your device. ZonkeyNet possesses no
    technical backdoors or private key escrows.

